[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_ARMY]
Army of Fear

[en.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_ARMY_desc]
The crystal ponies of the Crystal Empire seem to have lived in peace for too long, so long that they have forgotten what they used to be like - what they ought to be like.

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_ARMY]
恐惧部队

[zh.DECISION_C15_SOMBRA_SLAVE_ARMY_desc]
水晶帝国的小马似乎在和平中生活了太久，以至于他们忘记了曾经是怎么样的——他们应该是怎么样的。
